# Reviewers by path.
#
# Only GitHub accounts with write access to this repository can be listed here;
# entries for outside accounts produce errors on every pull request.
#
# `main` currently has no branch protection, so this file documents intent
# rather than enforcing it. Pair it with a protection rule or ruleset to make
# the review requirement real.
#
# Once additional maintainers have write access, add them to the relevant line,
# for example:  /catalog/  @howdy-beep  @new-maintainer

*                       @howdy-beep

# Dataset: a bad row sends every visitor to the wrong place.
/catalog/               @howdy-beep

# Anything that parses or normalises catalog input.
/scripts/               @howdy-beep
/engine/                @howdy-beep

# Copy and claims: privacy statements must describe shipped behaviour.
/index.html             @howdy-beep
/guide.html             @howdy-beep

# Security policy changes are reviewed by the owner.
/SECURITY.md            @howdy-beep
